 🔧 Additional Deployment Tips

 Security:

   • Use strong SSH keys (disable password auth)
   • Configure firewall rules
   • Use environment variables for sensitive data
   • Keep MT5 credentials secure

 Monitoring:

   • Set up log rotation
   • Monitor resource usage
   • Set up alerts for failures
   • Use the  /api/system-health  endpoint

 Performance:

   • Start with 1-2 trading symbols
   • Monitor CPU/memory usage
   • Adjust polling frequency if needed
   • Use the feature flags to disable heavy features

